|     | a  b  c  |                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|             3      3                                                        |
|o6 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : W=minors(3,m1)+minors(3,m2);                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : f=random({1,1,1},R);                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : Y=ideal (z_0*W_0-z_1*W_1)+ideal(f);                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : X=((W)*ideal(y)+ideal(f));                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : Ideal of R                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : time isComponentContained(X,Y)                                         |
